This directory is a derivative NeoForge 1.21.1 port of NeepMeat for the Autisnautics pack.
Upstream: https://codeberg.org/MeatWheeze/NeepMeat
Pinned commit: 0d36776e4e78fd4049cbe9f556a5204d5e98c4ff (branch 1.20/dev, 2026-07-11)
Version declared upstream: 0.30.0-beta+1.20.1
There is no git tag named v0.30.0-beta. The version string is the one in that commit's gradle.properties.

The pack owner (Wyseman) reported that MeatWheeze gave permission to port. This port did not independently verify that permission. Upstream README asks porters to ask first.

Upstream ships LICENSE as the GNU Lesser General Public License version 3, and fabric.mod.json says "LGPL-3.0". Source file headers say the GNU General Public License version 3 or later. This port does not relicense the work. Both licence texts are in this directory (LICENSE and GPL-3.0.txt).

NEEPSpeak (submodule https://codeberg.org/MeatWheeze/NEEPSpeak, commit d409f84922a29436ead9ea0466152999ef8662f4) is included as source under the same LGPL-3.0 text. It is not a separate mod id.

Myron-NEEPMeat (submodule https://github.com/MeatWheeze/myron-neepmeat, commit aa49118d62af5392930fd4915dc42036a8641e89) is MIT, copyright 2021 (see licenses/Myron-MIT.txt). Its code is not in this jar. The Fabric OBJ loader and its mixins were not ported.

Flywheel is not included. Upstream depended on Flywheel Fabric 1.20.1 (dev.engine-room.flywheel:flywheel-fabric-1.20.1:1.0.6-278) from Maven. This checkout did not contain a vendored Flywheel jar; settings.gradle only has a commented include of subprojects:Flywheel.
